WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.050
A lot of small business owners

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:04.300
are losing money on marketing.

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:06.760
Almost 50% of them.

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:07.550
Most of the time,

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:09.030
they don't even know why.

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:11.210
They've tried agency after agency or

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.610
hired marketing staff internally,

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:16.060
but in the end, it just doesn't work out.

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:17.530
Their marketing doesn't produce

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:18.850
results consistently,

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:21.780
month after month, year after year.

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:23.750
There's always ups and downs and no

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.520
real reason why it's not performing.

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.970
The real reason why is that

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:30.880
you don't know marketing.

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:31.950
I'm not trying to insult you.

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:33.830
It's actually normal for small business

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:35.770
owners not to understand every part

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:37.880
of a business in the beginning.

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:39.950
Most of you never learned marketing,

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:41.790
so you hire an agency and they tell you

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:43.470
they have some proprietary framework

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:45.710
that's going to get you consistent leads.

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:46.570
But six months later,

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:47.930
you find out the framework was just

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:49.690
an AI bot they fed your information

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:52.250
to and it spit out a terrible plan.

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:53.410
You most likely saw the plan

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:55.460
and took it at face value.

00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:56.590
Because you didn't learn

00:00:56.590 --> 00:00:57.670
marketing as a subject,

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:00.430
you didn't know it was an awful plan.

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:01.730
Or you skip the agency and

00:01:01.730 --> 00:01:03.630
ask the AI bot yourself.

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:04.850
It'll give you an answer.

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:05.830
It'll write you a whole

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:07.430
market research report.

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:09.150
But that report comes from whatever is

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:10.930
publicly available on the internet.

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:12.610
If the AI made something up or

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:13.690
hallucinated its answers,

00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:15.010
you wouldn't know.

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:16.070
Unless you knew the subject

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:17.410
of marketing and knew how to

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:19.620
fact-check the AI's answers.

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:21.350
Before you even touch marketing or

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:23.570
post on social media or launch a new

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:25.390
website or send an email campaign,

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:28.080
you need to answer one question.

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:29.850
Who are you talking to?

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:31.780
And what do they want to hear?

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:33.210
A chatbot can't really

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:34.450
answer that for you.

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:35.990
It's never met your customer.

00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:37.690
It doesn't know human emotion.

00:01:37.690 --> 00:01:40.030
It doesn't understand pain points.

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:41.290
All it can do is pull from the

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:43.580
internet and tell you what's there.

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.590
My name is Devin Alexander and I've been a

