00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:49.590
I've run campaigns for small businesses

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:51.980
and multi-billion dollar enterprises.

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:53.850
I want to give you the keys to success

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:55.890
in marketing as a small business owner.

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:57.790
And that's two things.

00:01:57.790 --> 00:01:59.940
Knowledge and control.

